    "result_text": "All tests green. Here's a summary of what I implemented.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change makes `householdId` deterministic and reworks household handling in `OwnerRestControllerV1` and friends.\n\n**`computeHouseholdId(lastName, postcode)`** (`OwnerRestControllerV1.java`)\n- Now keyed on `(normalizedLastName + '|' + postcode)` instead of `(lastName, address)`.\n- Returns the first 12 hex characters of SHA-256 (no `HH-` prefix), per spec. An absent postcode contributes an empty string.\n\n**`addOwner` flow**\n- Every owner now gets a deterministic `householdId` computed unconditionally \u2014 it's no longer created only when `sharesHousehold` is set.\n- Added `requireNoHouseholdDuplicate(owner, declaredMember)`: if an existing owner already carries the same `householdId`, the create is rejected with **409** via a new `DuplicateHouseholdException` \u2014 **unless** `sharesHousehold` is set, which now only bypasses this block (it no longer \"creates the link\").\n- `flagPossibleDuplicate(owner, declaredMember)`: a declared household member is forced to `possibleDuplicate = false` (\"a declared member is not a suspected duplicate\").\n- Replaced `joinHousehold`/`findHouseholdMembers` with `stampHouseholdSize(owner)`, which computes household size from the shared `householdId` grouping (duplicate detection and household-size both now key off the computed id). `requireUniqueIdentity` already keyed off `householdId` through the identity key, which is now always populated.\n\n**New files / supporting changes**\n- `DuplicateHouseholdException.java` \u2014 carries the offending household id.\n- `ExceptionControllerAdvice` \u2014 handler mapping it to 409 Conflict with `errors: [\"household\"]`.\n- `openapi.yml` \u2014 updated the `householdId` and `sharesHousehold` descriptions to match the new semantics.\n\n**Tests**\n- `AcceptanceTest.coreSameLastNameAndPostcodeShareHouseholdId` passes (same lastName+postcode \u2192 same id with `sharesHousehold` bypassing the block; different lastName \u2192 different id).\n- Full suite: `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\nNote: no git repository here, so I made no commit (and there was nothing to commit against).",
